WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:03.045
- Mm-hmm. All right.
Hey, palsies!

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:05.172
My name is Cody,
and I'm a Helpster.

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:07.466
That means a monster who helps.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:10.886
And because I love, love, love
to help so much,

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.930
I'm making these videos called...

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:20.812
One of my favorite things
is to have friends over and play games.

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:22.731
But guess what?

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:26.944
You can play games with friends
when they're far away, too.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:31.532
Like right now, I'm going to
play a game with my friend...

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.492
- Ta-da!

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:35.786
- Amazing Alie!

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.581
- Cody, it is amazing to see you.

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.210
- Aw! I knew you were gonna say that.

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:48.465
Hey, Alie, please tell these
fabulous people what we're playing today.

00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:51.134
- The game is called "scavenger hunt."

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:54.513
The way that it works is Cody
will ask me to find something.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:57.808
- Yeah, and then Alie
asks me to find something.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:01.728
Oh, oh, oh, and we have to use
directional words when we find our stuff.

00:01:01.812 --> 00:01:03.564
- Like "on" or "under."

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:06.817
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, or--
or "next to" or "between."

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.112
Okay. You ready to play, Alie?

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:11.530
- So ready.

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:12.990
- Great! Okay.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:18.912
So, Amazing Alie,
can you find something...

00:01:18.996 --> 00:01:22.124
green? Hmm?

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:26.170
- Oh! Next to my chair is...

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:28.589
this plant.

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:33.135
- Oh! Alie, that is the greenest plant
I have ever seen.

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:37.639
You are amazing in every way.
Fantastic!

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:39.516
- Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.768
- Oh, you are very welcome,
Amazing Alie.

00:01:41.852 --> 00:01:44.438
Okay, uh, so, so you got--
you got one for me?

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:46.857
- Oh, you ready for this?

00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:52.613
Cody, can you find something
made of wood?

00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:55.157
- Hmm. Made of wood, huh?

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.618
Let's see, uh...

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:00.913
Oh. I got a good one for you.

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:04.458
Under my elephant is...

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:07.336
this wooden spoon!

00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:08.837
Huh? What do you think?

00:02:08.921 --> 00:02:10.756
- Amazing!
- Nice.

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:14.468
- Oh, wait a second.
Did you say it was under an elephant?

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:17.387
- Oh, yeah.
Yeah, under my elephant Lulu.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:18.680
(elephant trumpets)

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:21.141
- Whoa.
- Yeah, she'd come over and say hello,

00:02:21.225 --> 00:02:24.144
but right now
she's balancing on top of Julian.

00:02:24.228 --> 00:02:26.063
He's a rhinoceros.

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.231
(elephant trumpets)

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:29.775
And they're both
inside a rocket ship.

00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:33.028
'Cause they're about to
go into space. Oop!

00:02:33.111 --> 00:02:35.364
- Have fun, you two!
- (elephant trumpets, rockets roar)

00:02:35.447 --> 00:02:37.324
- Sounds like a busy day
at the shop.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:39.701
- Eh, not really.

00:02:39.785 --> 00:02:41.828
Well, anyway,
that's how you play scavenger hunt.

00:02:41.912 --> 00:02:44.206
- And now you can play
with your friends and family,

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:47.251
or you can create
a new amazing game.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:49.044
- Yeah, you can.

00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:52.005
Well, that's it for today,
but I'll be back soon.

00:02:52.089 --> 00:02:56.969
- Until then, make sure to help family,
friends, and monsters wherever you can.

00:02:57.052 --> 00:03:00.138
- Yeah.
'Cause everyone loves a helping hand.

00:03:00.222 --> 00:03:02.099
- Bye, Alie!
- Bye, Cody!

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:03.517
- Thanks so much
for playing with me today.

